                    "text": "Government shutdowns expose D.C.\u2019s twisted priorities\u2014protecting foreign aid and Pentagon bloat while threatening nutrition for 3.4M Texans. The 2025 budget reconciliation bill shifts SNAP costs to states, slashes funding, and imposes draconian work requirements that gut rural communities. Rural grocers in Duval and Starr counties rely on SNAP for 30% of revenue; cutting benefits risks collapsing their lifelines.\n\nMeanwhile, Congress greenlights $55M for the Joint Autonomy Office while families scramble. Prioritize American families over bureaucratic slush funds.\n\nAudit every dime before claiming \u201cno money\u201d for SNAP.",
